But careful: ASSIGN on line `document.write("<option value='" + lang + "'>...")` — regex would match `write(...)`? ASSIGN needs `name = ...`. `"<option value='" + lang` — hmm, `value='` — `([A-Za-z_$][\w$]*)\s*=\s*` could match `value=` inside the string! var=`value`, rhs=`'" + lang + "'>"...` — rhs contains tainted `lang` → adds `value` to tainted. Harmless.

